{"server":"tw","storyId":"act22side_level_act22side_st01","groupId":"act22side","stageId":"act22side_st01","title":"荒地鐘聲","storyCode":"FC-ST-1","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act22side/level_act22side_st01.txt","sourceHash":"11f536175cd6d9c585ae965354cb76c6c553901e71ee5c519f014463c048378f","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在矛盾日漸激化的塔拉地區，葦草出手搭救了兩名流民的性命。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_manorindoor"},{"type":"narration","text":"八年前\n1090年\n橡林郡"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風趣的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"伯爵閣下，不少人都在打聽您，想要瞭解我們下一步的行動計劃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風趣的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧了您的支持，我們的劇目大獲成功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風趣的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"塔拉人自己的劇院，塔拉人自己的歷史，首場演出就有兩百人前來觀看，多麼令人歡欣鼓舞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風趣的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，我們可以尋求與麥卡內尼男爵領地上的數家工廠合作，或者接受這幾名銀行家的聯合邀約......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些事情請在宴會後再談吧，珀斯爵士。或者，您交給一個打字員去安排，也不會出太多差錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天的宴會上，我們最好只談論剛結束的演出，談論塔拉的文明，拋下那些維多利亞人的繁文縟節和奔走鑽營。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，這些身份和禮儀，這些高雅的語句，我們賴以交流思想的體面詞彙，全都是維多利亞人教給我們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些東西就和維多利亞人的機器一樣，讓塔拉人的身心都染上了現代病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本我們只知道我們天性裡的高潔與勇毅，我們那繼承自蓋爾王的血液只要聽到戰鬥的號令就激動不已......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在，我們學會了維多利亞人的精明與虛榮，以至於面對一項正確的事業，一種理想的感召，許多人卻只能在其中進行利益的博弈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不僅我們自身如此，我們在大街上時常看到的，小市民中的塔拉人，也是如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們因為沾染了維多利亞人的惡德，而變成礦石病人，變成無賴與暴徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風趣的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"您說得真好，伯爵閣下——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著樸素的詩人","speakerId":"avg_npc_239","isRemote":false,"text":"——抱歉，我失手打碎了酒杯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來您的杯子有話要說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著樸素的詩人","speakerId":"avg_npc_239","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想問問您的看法，伯爵閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......原諒我這記性吧，請問您是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著樸素的詩人","speakerId":"avg_npc_239","isRemote":false,"text":"威廉姆斯，詩人，今晚那一齣戲劇的執筆人。但您不必費心記住我的名字，我在文壇還不能說有什麼建樹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威廉姆斯先生，別客氣。我說過，我最不喜歡維多利亞人的繁文縟節。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請問吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著樸素的詩人","speakerId":"avg_npc_239","isRemote":false,"text":"......您將塔拉人比作染病之人，那您認為，我們要如何自愈？要怎麼去救治其他塔拉人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕我們無論多麼努力，都不能根治我們身上的疾病，就像已經渾濁的水不能再將自己洗淨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著樸素的詩人","speakerId":"avg_npc_239","isRemote":false,"text":"所以您認為，那些無賴與暴徒，我們是不可能救助的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著樸素的詩人","speakerId":"avg_npc_239","isRemote":false,"text":"您不相信他們其實缺少知識和教育，而我們的筆能夠幫助他們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，太過精緻的知識正是我們的敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我們寫，我們呐喊，我們夢想一個塔拉的理想國......我們試圖喚醒血脈中沉睡的，關於塔拉的記憶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你我將是不得不留在這個舊時代的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您看，我很喜歡您的劇作，只是，我們都不得不使用維多利亞的語言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著樸素的詩人","speakerId":"avg_npc_239","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我放下戰士的榮譽，只為以後塔拉的土地不必再被鮮血浸泡，德拉克的同族不必再刀劍相向。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“除非有朝一日，紅龍的火焰能令死去的戰士從熔爐中復生。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著樸素的詩人","speakerId":"avg_npc_239","isRemote":false,"text":"承蒙您的謬愛，這些只是民間歌謠的記錄，我做的最多不過是音韻上的潤色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我只是在想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔拉未必不會再有下一條紅龍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃里克伯爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，如今我們誰也沒見過德拉克，又怎麼知道自己身邊走過的人其實不是瓦伊凡呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"1098年\n石高原野，紅脊鎮"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"找到了，在大街上活動的人就這兩個。剛才砸碎窗戶玻璃的聲音一定是他們弄出來的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你們老實點，不然下次繩子就不是套在你們的手腕上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"呸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你怎麼還這麼凶......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對、對不起！軍官老爺們！我們錯了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"是通緝令上跟深池串通的那一批人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"有一個在通緝令上，另一個之前沒見過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，我就知道，這些塔拉人都是串通一氣的，沒幾個好東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀！求您別動手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們拿的東西就這些，您都已經搜出來了......您要問什麼，我們一定老老實實交代......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"少廢話。你們那些同夥呢？去哪了？去給深池通風報信了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這個我真的不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們根本沒有什麼同夥，也沒見過深池的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不就是想隨便抓幾個人打死，給上面的貴族交差？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"呸！你們......你們這些維多利亞的混帳東西！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"還嘴硬？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"帶到屋子裡去，別讓這些惡棍在大街上鬧，吵到其他人休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"先問那個挎著包的。他要是老實，就讓他少受點苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我就是老實人啊，我什麼都不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，隊長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"附近好像還有其他人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那、那個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"那個挎包的在叫什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......火！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴，別想給你的同伴打掩護——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——可是你們背後起火了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"......是庫房那邊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"*維多利亞粗口*，把一隊的人叫起來！先救火！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，他們把我們扔下啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"維恩，快幫我把繩子解了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我怎麼幫你？我也被捆著......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......快走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g4_swamp_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，明明沒有你什麼事，結果害得你跟我們一起逃跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒事，我們甩掉那些人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，維恩，收音機呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這，應該還能用，就是聲音有點小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"聲音小也好，免得被發現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你聽聽消息吧，我去水塘邊洗把臉，冷靜一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊的瓦伊凡，你如果覺得危險，可以先走。我給你指個路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用......我可以在這裡等你們，幫你們放哨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，謝謝。你真是個好心人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別緊張，維恩，別緊張。你看不見，你就不會害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你摸到的不是血，真的不是血，就是沼澤地的泥巴，洗洗就乾淨了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"見鬼......喂！這玩意真的還能用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......求你小聲點！當兵的肯定還沒走遠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"多敲兩下，再搖一搖！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......晚九點三十分左右......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"行了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"特倫特郡附近聚落發生縱火事件......手法與深池叛亂份子相似......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嫌疑人三名，仍在逃跑中......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如有......深池叛亂份子線索，隱瞞不報者......視為與叛亂份子同罪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......再次警告......熄火鐘響後，禁止外出。礦場、工廠以外地區，禁止一切燈火......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"杜絕......一切與叛亂者勾結的活動......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（無信號的雜音）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"*塔拉粗口*。晚九點一過，真沒有其他廣播了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"這都是*塔拉粗口*的什麼規矩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......不好意思。我用塔拉語說髒話，你聽得懂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......但沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"還是不好意思。把你這個外人捲進來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係......塔拉人，在哪裡都是一樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前，我也來過石高原野。不過，那時候還沒有熄火鐘的規定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，那你應該是住在移動城市上面的人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"這個敲鐘的規矩，本來也有許多年啦，只有荒野上才聽得到，用來管著那些半夜偷偷鑽進什麼伯爵什麼子爵的獵場打獵的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"鐘聲一響，我們就把燈熄了，火也滅了。這時候荒野上如果有人點火把驅趕野獸，隔著老遠就能看得清清楚楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"只是新規定變嚴了，才有今天這樣的麻煩事。那些半夜巡邏的傢伙，在街上看到一個就抓一個。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，維恩，你冷靜啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃，我們的藥呢？是不是一點也沒剩下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你說呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。可惜了我的鋼筆，現在我連帳都沒法記了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"咱們就是去搶的，你就不該想著拿自己的東西去抵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們出來多少天了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"要是還沒過午夜，這是第十二天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。十二天了，我們根本沒走多遠。我總覺得要是天氣放晴，我還能看見村子的炊煙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們就這麼被當兵的追著，在這一帶兜圈子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說，我們真的能逃出去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們遇到什麼事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們跟巡邏隊起了點衝突，被通緝了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"維恩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我說吧，費加爾，我感覺得出來，這位女士是個好心人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時巡邏隊來我們這裡抓人，把犯過事的人都叫出來了。然後他們動手打人，我們就打回去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒打，維恩。別給自己邀功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我們也沒犯多大事，有家人交不上稅金跑了，巡邏隊揪著他們的親戚問情況。費加爾是釀了點自己喝的酒，我是賣東西的手續不齊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，以往大家都是老老實實認錯的，那天沒忍住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟巡邏隊打起來之後，跑出來的也不止我們兩個。我們有十幾個人，但凡那天被當兵的叫到名字的，都一起跑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦那些當兵的想抓人，誰都逃不掉。我們靠一張嘴說自己清白，他們是不會信的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們打死了人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"是，我們幹倒了兩個，一個是一開始趁他們沒防備用鋤頭砸倒的，另一個是混戰裡趁機放倒的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，還是讓剩下那個跑了，不然當兵的哪知道我們幹了什麼事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉！要是能多一夜的時間逃走，我們都不會這麼慘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......費加爾，我們有沒有可能，去跟當兵的自首？我自己去自首也行。這逃亡的日子我撐不下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們沒弄到藥，只能看著奧蘭的傷口慢慢爛掉，人也......我受不了這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你別想著什麼自首，你以為當兵的會給你個痛快？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"才不會。他們會先折磨你，威脅你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你這種人呢，只要兩分鐘，就會把我們的事情全說出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，可我們沒有藥，被傷病折磨，不也一樣是折磨嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們，很缺藥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......我們確實是被其他人派來弄點藥的，他們還在挺遠的地方等著我們呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本來是來買藥的，真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們心裡都知道，熄火鐘一敲，商鋪都會關門。我們肯定來不及在鐘聲響起之前趕到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我們估計了一下巡邏隊的換班時間，呃，砸了藥鋪的窗戶玻璃......我還以為那個時候他們注意不到呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你呢，你像是城市裡來的，為什麼要跑到這麼荒涼的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在找一些東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，瞭解“深池”嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"止血劑和繃帶，我其實帶了一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維恩先生，我看見你受傷了......處理一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，被你發現了？其實也不是大事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，你願意分我一點藥品的話，那就太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的同伴傷得很重，我想帶給他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃，被鉗獸咬的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，我可以跟你們一起......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那邊！泥巴上有腳印，往那個方向去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那幾個放火的塔拉渣滓！一定在附近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——快、快躲起來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有......一整隊，半打人，手電筒往這邊照過來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"快點，彎下腰，這邊走！這裡的地是實的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係的......那些士兵在沼澤地也不敢走得太快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——噓。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（維恩，我都能聽到你牙齒在打顫！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（我......唔......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"手電筒向他們照了過來。\n葦草握緊手中的長槍，金屬不斷升溫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵？","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁！憑什麼你們能打手電筒！看著就來氣！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"深池？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"抓住她！她身上一定能挖出情報！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵？","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓我？想都別想！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"呸！怎麼扔泥巴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"走，維恩，我們得去幫她！別當膽小鬼！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，哎，好......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵？","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，這幾個新兵，處理起來不費什麼勁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵？","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，維恩，費加爾！你們到底把事情辦成什麼樣子了？要是我不出來找你們，你們是不是得死在這？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，是啊。多虧了你，撿回一條命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就跟你說了，這種打砸搶燒的事我可能做不好......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，塞爾蒙，你要幹什麼？把他們打昏過去就夠了，你難道還要全都殺了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那樣的話，我們身上的罪名得多重？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼區別？只要他們想抓塔拉人，罪名輕重都無所謂，抓到了人，他們就不會活著放走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，可是自己心裡輕重還是有區別的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"膽小鬼。你看好了，我就是要把這些維多利亞的混帳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......住手。別這麼做。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，盯著我幹嘛？準備打小報告？試試看啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"舉報？不，你根本不是深池的人。為什麼......要穿成這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼要模仿鬼魂部隊的做事方法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——你憑什麼這麼說？你很瞭解深池？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，冷靜點，塞爾蒙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她只是個醫生，剛剛跟我們一起逃出來的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我覺得她是個好人。我把我們的事情都告訴她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，那個，醫生......你說跟我們一起去看看傷患的事，還算數嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞爾蒙，你真的得冷靜點......我們把事情搞砸了，沒拿到藥。這位好心的醫生說她能幫我們，現在我們只能靠她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘁，我說了不算。是這位醫生看起來認識我這身衣服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，我不是醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我還是想，試著幫助你們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
